* Nested reusable goal: apply the same field-entry pattern to multiple fields.
Goal: Complete a profile form
. Goal: Enter field <name field> <full name>
.. Look at <name field>
.. Click <name field>
.. Hands to keyboard
.. Type <full name>
.. Verify <full name> is displayed
. Goal: Enter profile details
.. @Goal Enter field <name field> <full name>
.. @Goal Enter field <email field> <email address>
.. @Goal Enter field <phone field> <phone number>
. Goal: Save profile
.. Look at <save button>
.. Click <save button>
.. Verify profile is saved
